    "summary": "========================================================================================================================\nLayer (type:depth-idx)                        Input Shape               Output Shape              Param #\n========================================================================================================================\nHead                                          [2, 768]                  [2, 47]                   --\n\u251c\u2500GaussianNoise: 1-1                          [2, 768]                  [2, 768]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Serial: 1-2                                 [2, 768]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2514\u2500ModuleList: 2-1                        --                        --                        --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dense: 3-1                        [2, 768]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Sequential: 4-1              [2, 768]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Linear: 5-1             [2, 768]                  [2, 256]                  196,864\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Norm: 5-2               [2, 256]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Identity: 6-1      [2, 256]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Activation: 5-3         [2, 256]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500ReLU: 6-2          [2, 256]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2502    \u2514\u2500Dropout: 5-4            [2, 256]                  [2, 256]                  --\n\u251c\u2500Linear: 1-3                                 [2, 256]                  [2, 47]                   12,079\n========================================================================================================================\nTotal params: 208,943\nTrainable params: 208,943\nNon-trainable params: 0\nTotal mult-adds (Units.MEGABYTES): 0.42\n========================================================================================================================\nInput size (MB): 0.01\nForward/backward pass size (MB): 0.00\nParams size (MB): 0.84\nEstimated Total Size (MB): 0.85\n========================================================================================================================"
